      "description": "Forward/footer action with the survey's 44px minimum height.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\" type=\"button\">Continuar<svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button>",
