      "description": "Whole-row selection, 20px box, 48px minimum row height, visible keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-choice\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked class=\"ds-choice-input\"><span class=\"ds-choice-box\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg></span><span>Analizar comentarios, reclamos, reseñas o conversaciones de clientes</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-choice{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:48px;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--color-neutral-900,#171717);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms;font-family:'Montserrat Variable','Montserrat',sans-serif;}.ds-choice:hover{background:var(--color-neutral-50,#fafafa)}.ds-choice:has(input:checked){background:var(--color-indigo-50,#eef2ff)}.ds-choice:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--color-indigo-700,#432dd7);outline-offset:-2px}.ds-choice-input{position:absolute;opacity:0;width:20px;height:20px}.ds-choice-box{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;width:18px;height:18px;border:1px solid var(--color-neutral-300,#d4d4d4);border-radius:4px;background:white;color:white}.ds-choice-box svg{visibility:hidden}.ds-choice:has(input:checked) .ds-choice-box{background:var(--color-indigo-700,#432dd7);border-color:var(--color-indigo-700,#432dd7)}.ds-choice:has(input:checked) svg{visibility:visible}@media(max-width:639px){.ds-choice{padding:12px 8px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-btn-primary,.ds-btn-secondary,.ds-btn-tertiary,.ds-text-shell,.ds-choice,.ds-progress-fill{transition:none}}"
